        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joshua's Farewell to the Leaders",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After a long time had passed and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had given Israel rest from all their enemies around them, Joshua, by then a very old man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "summoned all Israel—their elders, leaders, judges and officials—and said to them: \"I am very old.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You yourselves have seen everything the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God has done to all these nations for your sake; it was the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God who fought for you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember how I have allotted as an inheritance for your tribes all the land of the nations that remain—the nations I conquered—between the Jordan and the Mediterranean Sea in the west.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God himself will push them out for your sake. He will drive them out before you, and you will take possession of their land, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God promised you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Be very strong; be careful to obey all that is written in the Book of the Law of Moses, without turning aside to the right or to the left.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not associate with these nations that remain among you; do not invoke the names of their gods or swear by them. You must not serve them or bow down to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you are to hold fast to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, as you have until now.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has driven out before you great and powerful nations; to this day no one has been able to withstand you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One of you routs a thousand, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God fights for you, just as he promised.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So be very careful to love the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But if you turn away and ally yourselves with the survivors of these nations that remain among you and if you intermarry with them and associate with them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then you may be sure that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God will no longer drive out these nations before you. Instead, they will become snares and traps for you, whips on your backs and thorns in your eyes, until you perish from this good land, which the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God has given you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Now I am about to go the way of all the earth. You know with all your heart and soul that not one of all the good promises the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God gave you has failed. Every promise has been fulfilled; not one has failed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But just as all the good things the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God has promised you have come to you, so he will bring on you all the evil things he has threatened, until the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God has destroyed you from this good land he has given you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you violate the covenant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, which he commanded you, and go and serve other gods and bow down to them, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.23.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anger will burn against you, and you will quickly perish from the good land he has given you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
